	(text "Source capability from the CC voltage (firmware, through the monitor converter):\n0.25 V to 0.61 V default USB, 0.70 V to 1.16 V 1.5 A, 1.31 V to 2.04 V 3 A.\n+3V3_C: logic of the carrier.  +3V3_A: converter, its driver and the comparators.\nH301 to H304: mounting holes, tied to ground."
